flowchart TD
    START([Student Selects Join Course]) --> CODE[/Enter Course Join Code/]
    CODE --> VALID{Code Valid and Course in Authorized Institute?}
    VALID -->|No| ERROR[Show Invalid Code / Institute Error]
    ERROR -->|Retry| CODE
    VALID -->|Yes| EXISTS{Existing Approved or Pending Enrollment?}
    EXISTS -->|Yes| STATUS[Show Existing Status; Do Not Create Duplicate]
    STATUS --> RETURN([Return to Student Dashboard])
    EXISTS -->|No| SAVE[Save Pending Enrollment Request]
    SAVE --> PENDING[Show Pending Status; Course Access Not Granted]
    PENDING -->|Continue Using LMS| RETURN
    PENDING -.->|Later| REVIEW[Assigned Instructor Reviews Request]
    REVIEW --> DECISION{Recorded Request Status?}
    DECISION -->|Approved| APPROVED[Course Access Granted]
    DECISION -->|Rejected| REJECTED[Course Access Not Granted]
    DECISION -->|Pending| WAIT[Await Instructor Decision]
    APPROVED --> RETURN
    REJECTED --> RETURN
    WAIT --> RETURN
